
# machine translated (Brazilian Portuguese), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Settings' words for a port: it did not start, Trindle switched it off and on once, and a device came up. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-worked = A porta USB { $port } não iniciou, então o Trindle a desligou e ligou uma vez. Um dispositivo apareceu.

# Settings' words for a port: it did not start, Trindle restarted the USB controller, and a device came up. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-worked-controller = A porta USB { $port } não iniciou, então o Trindle reiniciou o controlador USB dela. Um dispositivo apareceu.

# Settings' words for a port: it did not start, the USB controller was restarted, and nothing came up. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-nothing-controller = A porta USB { $port } não iniciou. O Trindle reiniciou o controlador USB dela e nada apareceu. Desligue e ligue o computador para trazê-la de volta.

# Settings' words for a port: nothing came back after it was switched off and on, and the controller was not restarted. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-nothing = A porta USB { $port } não voltou depois de uma reinicialização. Desligue e ligue o computador para trazê-la de volta.
